                                </h3>
                                <p><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> Yarın, 10:00-11:00</p>
                                <p><i class="fas fa-video"></i> Video Görüşme</p>
                                <span class="session-status status-scheduled">Planlandı</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="session-actions">
                                <a href="/therapist/sessions/204/notes" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline">Notlar</a>
